Text Flash Cuts — "Behind You" (身后) (library demo)
Every third-party asset in the film, with its source and licence.

STORY, CHARACTERS AND TEXT
- Fictional. The series "身后 / Behind You", its two characters, all lines and the release note are invented for this demo.
  No existing anime, character, line, card text or logo is used. The visual grammar follows the early-2000s TV-anime
  "text frame" school; no frame of any existing work was used as a reference image.

IMAGES (Codex 生图 / generated with Codex image generation)
- 11 character and insert images generated with Codex CLI's built-in image generation through core/image/gen_image.py
  (prompts and --ref chain in prompts/prompts.json and prompts/README.md). Two of them (char_lookback, eye) were generated first without a
  reference; the other nine use char_lookback as the --ref for character and drawing style.
- These images belong to this demo only. A film on another topic generates its own characters (STYLE.md §9);
  the demo's images are not reused.
- Architecture, cards, rails, rain, the fallen umbrella, the phone, lockers, windows and all type are drawn in code (main.js).

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1; subsets fetched from Google Fonts by tools/fonts.sh)
- Noto Serif SC (Black 900), Google / Adobe
- Noto Sans SC (Black 900), Google / Adobe
- Cormorant Garamond (SemiBold Italic 600), Christian Thalmann (Catharsis Fonts)

MUSIC AND SOUND
- Original score and procedural sound design written for this film (mix.py); hits, foley, rain, drone synthesised with numpy (core/audio/sfx.py).
- Samples (CC0 1.0, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition and
  Versilian Community Sample Library, by Versilian Studios (Sam Gossner)
  (harpsichord, contrabass, cellos, violins, glockenspiel, woodblock, timpani, gran cassa, snare, trombone, tuba, horn,
  tubular bells, tam-tam, suspended cymbal, bowed vibraphone)

TOOLS
- Rendering: headless Chromium (Playwright); ffmpeg.
